From: ShareOS <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mdadm.h: include libgen.h for basename() (musl, GCC 14+)

musl does not declare the GNU basename() in <string.h>; with GCC 14 and
later the implicit declaration is an error (Incremental.c, mdmonitor.c,
platform-intel.c, super-intel.c).

--- a/mdadm.h
+++ b/mdadm.h
@@ -30,2 +30,3 @@
 #include	<assert.h>
+#include	<libgen.h>
 #include	<asm/byteorder.h>
